OL,3,AVeterans shouldn't sleep rough this
OL,4,AChristmas, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo one who served in the UK armed
OL,7,Fforces should have to sleep on the
OL,8,Fstreets this Christmas, Andy Burnham
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FDowning Street said the PM would
OL,12,Fpersonally write to councils across
OL,13,FEngland on Armistice Day (11 November)
OL,14,Fto urge them to draw up plans to offer
OL,15,Faccommodation for veterans sleeping
OL,16,Frough ahead of the festive period.
OL,18,FHe will say that national and local
OL,19,Fgovernment should work under the
OL,20,F"simple principle" that "no one who has
OL,21,Fserved our country should ever be left
OL,22,Fto sleep rough on our streets".
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
